# Used by user_slack_handle() in ci/bash-lib.yml to @-mention the commit
# author in CI Slack notifications (e.g. main-branch build failures).
#
# One entry per line, space-separated: <git-author-email> <slack-user-id>
# The Slack user id (e.g. U0123ABCD) is under Slack profile -> "Copy member ID".
